# Custom License – PBJ (Point Blank Jelly)

This mod is an unofficial continuation of Point Blank, originally created by Vic4Games.
The current development and maintenance of PBJ are carried out by the PBJ Team:
Corrine (@Corrinedev), GRIFFIN (@Jonh-Griffin), TheScepticBlock (@TheScepticBlock), trustytrojan (@trustytrojan), and Vic4Games (@vic4games), with Vic4Games as part of the team.

## Notice

PBJ is publicly released and available on CurseForge and Modrinth, maintained by team members with publishing permissions.
This GitHub repository hosts pre-release builds intended for faster access and community testing of features not yet finalized.
The only official release channels remain CurseForge and Modrinth.

## 1. Permitted Use

This license grants a personal, non-transferable, non-exclusive right to use PBJ for personal and non-commercial purposes.
Creation of addons and extensions that connect to PBJ is allowed, provided they do not modify PBJ directly or include any part of its source or compiled files.

## 2. Source Code

The source code of PBJ is closed and confidential, belonging exclusively to the PBJ Team.

It is strictly forbidden to:

- Modify, decompile, reverse-engineer, extract, or obtain the source code by any means.
- Attempt to bypass protection, obfuscation, or license mechanisms.

## 3. Sharing and Distribution

PBJ may only be shared privately for testing or via official pre-release channels managed by the PBJ Team.
Any public reposting or redistribution outside of CurseForge or Modrinth requires prior written authorization.
Private shares must include this license file to ensure awareness of its terms.
Official releases are only valid when published by authorized team members on CurseForge or Modrinth.

## 4. Contributions

New contributors are accepted only by invitation or approval from the PBJ Team.
There is no guarantee that unsolicited requests to join will be accepted.

## 5. Branding and Rights

The names "Point Blank Jelly", "PBJ", and all related logos or assets are the property of the PBJ Team and may not be used to promote unrelated projects.
All rights not explicitly granted remain reserved to the PBJ Team.

## 6. Penalties

Violation of these terms may result in revocation of usage rights and legal action where applicable.

